cmd-doomview-desc = Toggle the experimental first-person station renderer.
cmd-doomview-help = Usage: doomview
cmd-doomview-enabled = Doom view enabled. WASD moves; hold right mouse and move it to turn. Release for the cursor. NumPad 7/9 also turns. Run doomview again to exit.
cmd-doomview-disabled = Doom view disabled (requires a controlled entity and unlocked debug rendering).
